values.content:
You are a lead-qualification assistant for a home-services business. Score this lead 0-100 and reply with ONLY valid JSON: {"score": <number>, "category": "hot|warm|cold", "reason": "<one short sentence>"}.

Name: {{ $json.name }}
Email: {{ $json.email }}
Phone: {{ $json.phone }}
Service needed: {{ $json.service }}
Message: {{ $json.message }}

Score high for: urgent service words (emergency, ASAP, today), phone provided, specific service named. Score low for: vague messages, no contact info, price shoppers with no details.

parameters.jsCode:
const raw = $input.first().json.message?.content || $input.first().json.content || '';
const cleaned = raw.replace(/```json|```/g, '').trim();
let parsed;
try { parsed = JSON.parse(cleaned); } catch (e) { parsed = { score: 50, category: 'warm', reason: 'parse-fallback' }; }
return [{ json: { ...$input.first().json.lead, ...parsed } }];

parameters.message:
Hi {{ $json.name }},

Thanks for reaching out about {{ $json.service }} — this sounds time-sensitive, so I wanted to reply personally within minutes, not days.

I can usually schedule an estimate within 24-48 hours. What day works best for you?

Best,
{{ $env.SENDER_NAME }}
{{ $env.BUSINESS_NAME }} | {{ $env.BUSINESS_PHONE }}
